{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Step 4: break it on purpose\n1. Change only the **name** of the process to `Student request (test)`. Deploy. In Operate, how many versions of `student-request` are there?\n2. Change only the **ID** to `student-request-test`. Deploy. Is it a new version or a new process?\n3. Put the ID back to `student-request`.",
      "id": "class_s01_break_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Feedback.** {{fbBreak}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbBreak = null or fbBreak = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s01_break_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "nameChange",
      "label": "When you changed only the name and deployed, you got...",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "a new version of the same process",
          "value": "newVersion"
        },
        {
          "label": "a new, different process",
          "value": "newProcess"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s01_break_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "idChange",
      "label": "When you changed only the ID and deployed, you got...",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "a new version of the same process",
          "value": "newVersion"
        },
        {
          "label": "a new, different process",
          "value": "newProcess"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s01_break_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "key": "checkpoint2",
      "label": "Checkpoint 2. In one sentence: what identifies a process for the engine?",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s01_break_4"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s01-break",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
